meta {
  name: Get Inventory Room
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/inventory/room
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Inventory Room

  This request is used to get all inventory room. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Inventory fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "inventory room fetched",
    "data": [
      { "inventory_room": "Main Room" }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — inventory room failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "inventory room not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}